 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far January to February sits at 55%. Grid 23285 had its driest year in 1999 at 62%.</p>"}
